NEARS-3640 QA — live-reproduced task_bug
Device: emulator-5556, package com.izzes.nears.nears_nears_3640_edit_profile_redesign, pid 18617
Repro: Edit Profile -> avatar sheet -> Remove Photo (staged) -> tap Update (real save, safe no-op
round trip since seeded account already had no photo) -> server returns 200 -> app throws an
uncaught Flutter framework assertion while popping the screen. App still lands on Home
(both Get.back() calls execute) but the exception is real, uncaught, and reproducible every time
this exact path (PopScope + a controller-initiated double Get.back() on save success) is taken.

